## 5. Registration & Payment Sequence Diagram

```
User                 Frontend              Backend                  Razorpay           MySQL
 |                      |                     |                        |                  |
 |-- Fill form -------> |                     |                        |                  |
 |-- Submit ----------> |                     |                        |                  |
 |                      |-- POST /registrations ------------------>    |                  |
 |                      |                     |-- Validate fields      |                  |
 |                      |                     |-- Check event open     |                  |
 |                      |                     |-- Check max slots      |                  |
 |                      |                     |-- Upload to S3         |                  |
 |                      |                     |-- INSERT registration (PENDING_PAYMENT) -> |
 |                      |                     |-- Create Razorpay Order ----------->       |
 |                      |                     |<--------- order_id ------------------       |
 |                      |                     |-- INSERT payment (CREATED) ----------->    |
 |                      |<-- 201 {orderId, keyId, amount} -----                           |
 |                      |-- Open Razorpay Checkout                                         |
 |-- Pay ------------>  |                     |                        |                  |
 |                      |                     |<-------- webhook (payment.captured) ----  |
 |                      |                     |-- Verify HMAC signature                   |
 |                      |                     |-- BEGIN TX                                |
 |                      |                     |-- SELECT reg FOR UPDATE ------------>     |
 |                      |                     |-- Check not already PAID                  |
 |                      |                     |-- Verify amount/currency                  |
 |                      |                     |-- UPDATE payment → CAPTURED               |
 |                      |                     |-- Generate reg number (atomic)            |
 |                      |                     |-- UPDATE registration → PAID              |
 |                      |                     |-- INCREMENT event.registration_count      |
 |                      |                     |-- COMMIT TX                               |
 |                      |-- POST /payments/verify (frontend callback) ->                  |
 |                      |                     |-- Verify signature (same logic)           |
 |                      |                     |-- If already PAID: idempotent success     |
 |                      |<-- {registrationNumber, PAID} ----------                        |
 |<-- Show success ---- |                                                                 |
```

