## 9. Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q1 — Registration Number Format**: Should registration numbers be sequential (`EVT2026-000001`) or a shorter alphanumeric code (`EVT26-A7K92P`)? Sequential is simpler and more user-friendly. **Default: sequential.**

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q2 — Aadhaar Upload Timing**: Should Aadhaar be uploaded before payment (current plan) or only after successful payment (via separate step)? Uploading before is simpler UX but stores the document even for failed payments. **Default: upload before payment, delete abandoned files via S3 lifecycle policy.**

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q3 — Authentication for Admin endpoints**: There is currently no auth system. Admin presigned-URL endpoints need protection. Should we add a simple API-key header for now, or defer this? **Default: API-key header for admin endpoints.**

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q4 — Flyway baseline**: The existing DB has tables created by `ddl-auto=update`. These need to be dropped. Please confirm this is acceptable.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q5 — mssql-jdbc dependency**: The POM includes a SQL Server driver that doesn't match the MySQL datasource. Should we remove it? **Default: remove it.**

